EESchema-DOCLIB  Version 2.0
#
$CMP AUXGOAT_PWR
D AuxGoat carrier: USB-C input, protection, 5V rail, analog 3V3 LDO
K auxgoat carrier cm4
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP AUXGOAT_CM4
D AuxGoat carrier: Raspberry Pi CM4 module and its two DF40 connectors
K auxgoat carrier cm4
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP AUXGOAT_AUDIO
D AuxGoat carrier: PCM5102A I2S DAC, -6dB pad, 3.5mm line out
K auxgoat carrier cm4
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP AUXGOAT_LED
D AuxGoat carrier: five-state RGB status indicator, plain GPIO
K auxgoat carrier cm4
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP AUXGOAT_BTN
D AuxGoat carrier: long-press provisioning button, debounced
K auxgoat carrier cm4
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP AUXGOAT_SEC
D AuxGoat carrier: ATECC608B secure element on I2C1
K auxgoat carrier cm4
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP AUXGOAT_USB_DEV
D AuxGoat carrier: rpiboot USB device port and nRPIBOOT jumper
K auxgoat carrier cm4
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP AUXGOAT_USB_HOST
D AuxGoat carrier: current-limited USB 2.0 host port
K auxgoat carrier cm4
$ENDCMP
#
$CMP AUXGOAT_THERM
D AuxGoat carrier: fan header, not populated
K auxgoat carrier cm4
$ENDCMP
